{
  "items": [
    {"id": "p3_001", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "钟面上时针刚走过数字3，分针正指着3，这时的时刻是（　）", "options": ["A. 3时3分", "B. 3时15分", "C. 3时30分", "D. 3时45分"], "answer": "B", "kps": ["kp_p3_time_read"], "difficulty": 0.15, "solution": "分针指1大格是5分，指着3就是3×5=15分，所以是3时15分。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["p34-reviewer", "recheck-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p3_002", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "体育课从9时40分开始，到10时15分结束，体育课一共上了____分钟。", "answer": "35", "kps": ["kp_p3_time_read"], "difficulty": 0.3, "solution": "9时40分到10时是20分，再到10时15分加15分，共20+15=35分。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["p34-reviewer", "recheck-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p3_003", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "小华下午2时20分到少年宫，4时50分离开，他在少年宫一共待了____分钟。", "answer": "150", "kps": ["kp_p3_time_read"], "difficulty": 0.45, "solution": "2时20分到4时20分是2时=120分，再加30分，共120+30=150分。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["p34-reviewer", "recheck-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p3_004", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "数学课本的厚度大约是6____。", "answer": "毫米", "kps": ["kp_p3_measure_units"], "difficulty": 0.15, "solution": "1厘米=10毫米，课本厚度不到1厘米，用毫米作单位，约6毫米。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["p34-reviewer", "recheck-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p3_005", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "下面的换算中，正确的是（　）", "options": ["A. 3分米=30毫米", "B. 5千米=5000米", "C. 2吨=200千克", "D. 80厘米=80分米"], "answer": "B", "kps": ["kp_p3_measure_units"], "difficulty": 0.3, "solution": "1千米=1000米，5×1000=5000米；A应为300毫米，C应为2000千克，D应为8分米。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["p34-reviewer", "recheck-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p3_006", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "一辆卡车载重5吨，要一次运走6000千克货物，____（填“能”或“不能”）。", "answer": "不能", "kps": ["kp_p3_measure_units"], "difficulty": 0.45, "solution": "5吨=5000千克，5000＜6000，一次运不完。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["p34-reviewer", "recheck-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p3_007", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "计算345+278，正确的结果是（　）", "options": ["A. 513", "B. 613", "C. 623", "D. 633"], "answer": "C", "kps": ["kp_p3_addsub_3digit"], "difficulty": 0.2, "solution": "个位5+8=13写3进1，十位4+7+1=12写2进1，百位3+2+1=6，得623。选A、B是把进位的1漏加了。", "misconceptions": ["mc_p3_addsub_carry"], "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["p34-reviewer", "recheck-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p3_008", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "计算900-456=444，用“减数+差=被减数”验算的算式是____。", "answer": "456+444=900", "kps": ["kp_p3_addsub_3digit"], "difficulty": 0.3, "solution": "验算时用减数加差看是否等于被减数：456+444=900，说明计算正确。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["p34-reviewer", "recheck-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p3_009", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "下面算式的结果最接近600的是（　）", "options": ["A. 589+17", "B. 612-28", "C. 498+105", "D. 700-95"], "answer": "C", "kps": ["kp_p3_addsub_3digit"], "difficulty": 0.45, "solution": "A=606，B=584，C=603，D=605；与600相差最小的是603，选C。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["p34-reviewer", "recheck-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p3_010", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "△有3个，○的个数是△的2倍，○有____个。", "answer": "6", "kps": ["kp_p3_multiple_times"], "difficulty": 0.15, "solution": "求一个数的几倍是多少用乘法：3×2=6个。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["p34-reviewer", "recheck-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p3_011", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "饲养组养了12只兔子、4只鸭子，兔子的只数是鸭子的（　）倍。", "options": ["A. 2", "B. 3", "C. 4", "D. 6"], "answer": "B", "kps": ["kp_p3_multiple_times"], "difficulty": 0.3, "solution": "求一个数是另一个数的几倍用除法：12÷4=3倍。选A、D的同学容易用减法算相差数。", "misconceptions": ["mc_p3_times_div"], "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["p34-reviewer", "recheck-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p3_012", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "商店有5盒铅笔，每盒8支。钢笔的支数是铅笔的3倍，钢笔有____支。", "answer": "120", "kps": ["kp_p3_multiple_times"], "difficulty": 0.45, "solution": "先求铅笔总数5×8=40支，再求钢笔40×3=120支。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["p34-reviewer", "recheck-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p3_013", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "200×3=（　）", "options": ["A. 6", "B. 60", "C. 600", "D. 6000"], "answer": "C", "kps": ["kp_p3_mult_1digit"], "difficulty": 0.15, "solution": "先算2×3=6，再添上2个0，得600。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["p34-reviewer", "recheck-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p3_014", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "125×4=____。", "answer": "500", "kps": ["kp_p3_mult_1digit"], "difficulty": 0.3, "solution": "5×4=20写0进2，2×4+2=10写0进1，1×4+1=5，得500。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["p34-reviewer", "recheck-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p3_015", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "计算304×5，正确的结果是（　）", "options": ["A. 1520", "B. 1502", "C. 15200", "D. 1020"], "answer": "A", "kps": ["kp_p3_mult_1digit"], "difficulty": 0.4, "solution": "4×5=20写0进2，0×5+2=2，3×5=15，得1520；十位上的0也要乘。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["p34-reviewer", "recheck-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p3_016", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "封闭图形一周的长度，就是这个图形的____。", "answer": "周长", "kps": ["kp_p3_perimeter"], "difficulty": 0.1, "solution": "一周的长度就是周长。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["p34-reviewer", "recheck-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p3_017", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "长方形菜地长8米、宽5米，沿菜地四周围一圈篱笆，篱笆长（　）米。", "options": ["A. 13", "B. 26", "C. 40", "D. 16"], "answer": "B", "kps": ["kp_p3_perimeter"], "difficulty": 0.3, "solution": "长方形周长=（长+宽）×2=（8+5）×2=26米；选C的同学误用面积算法8×5。", "misconceptions": ["mc_p3_peri_area_mix"], "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["p34-reviewer", "recheck-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p3_018", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "正方形花坛的周长是36米，它的边长是____米。", "answer": "9", "kps": ["kp_p3_perimeter"], "difficulty": 0.35, "solution": "正方形周长=边长×4，边长=36÷4=9米。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["p34-reviewer", "recheck-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p3_019", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "把一块月饼平均分成4块，小明吃了1块，他吃了这块月饼的____。", "answer": "1/4", "kps": ["kp_p3_fraction_intro"], "difficulty": 0.15, "solution": "平均分成4份，1份就是四分之一，写作1/4。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["p34-reviewer", "recheck-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p3_020", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "同样大的两块蛋糕：第一块平均分成5份取1份，第二块平均分成2份取1份，取出的两块相比（　）", "options": ["A. 第一块大", "B. 第二块大", "C. 一样大", "D. 无法比较"], "answer": "B", "kps": ["kp_p3_fraction_intro"], "difficulty": 0.4, "solution": "取的都是1份，分的份数越多每份越小：1/5＜1/2，所以第二块大。误选A是把1/5当成了比1/2大。", "misconceptions": ["mc_p3_frac_compare"], "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["p34-reviewer", "recheck-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p3_021", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "一块巧克力平均分成8块，小红吃了2块，小刚吃了3块，两人一共吃了这块巧克力的____。", "answer": "5/8", "kps": ["kp_p3_fraction_intro"], "difficulty": 0.45, "solution": "2/8+3/8=5/8，同分母分数相加，分母不变分子相加。", "misconceptions": ["mc_p3_frac_add"], "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["p34-reviewer", "recheck-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p3_022", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "30支铅笔装一盒，90支铅笔正好装满（　）盒。", "options": ["A. 2", "B. 3", "C. 4", "D. 5"], "answer": "B", "kps": ["kp_p3_div_1digit"], "difficulty": 0.15, "solution": "90÷30=3（盒），想30×3=90。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["p34-reviewer", "recheck-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p3_023", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "□42÷3的商是140，□里填的数是____。", "answer": "4", "kps": ["kp_p3_div_1digit"], "difficulty": 0.3, "solution": "被除数=商×除数=140×3=420，所以□=4。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["p34-reviewer", "recheck-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p3_024", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "老师买来125瓶矿泉水，平均分给3个班，每班分得____瓶，还剩____瓶。（依次填商、余数，用“、”隔开）", "answer": "41、2", "kps": ["kp_p3_div_1digit"], "difficulty": 0.35, "solution": "125÷3=41……2；验算3×41+2=125。写成“40、5”的同学，余数5比除数3大了，商小了要调大。", "misconceptions": ["mc_p3_div_remainder"], "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["p34-reviewer", "recheck-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p3_025", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "每块橡皮2元，买20块需要____元。", "answer": "40", "kps": ["kp_p3_mult_2x2digit"], "difficulty": 0.15, "solution": "两位数乘整十数：2×20=40元。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["p34-reviewer", "recheck-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p3_026", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "学校开运动会，每个班要准备12把小椅子，30个班一共要准备（　）把。", "options": ["A. 306", "B. 360", "C. 300", "D. 380"], "answer": "B", "kps": ["kp_p3_mult_2x2digit"], "difficulty": 0.3, "solution": "12×30：先算12×3=36，再添1个0，得360。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["p34-reviewer", "recheck-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p3_027", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "学校组织24个班观看演出，每个班发32张票。估算时把24看作20、32看作30，大约需要____张票。", "answer": "600", "kps": ["kp_p3_mult_2x2digit"], "difficulty": 0.45, "solution": "20×30=600，所以大约需要600张票。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["p34-reviewer", "recheck-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p3_028", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "两个长方形相比：①长5厘米、宽2厘米；②长4厘米、宽3厘米。面积更大的是（　）", "options": ["A. ①大", "B. ②大", "C. 一样大", "D. 无法比较"], "answer": "B", "kps": ["kp_p3_area"], "difficulty": 0.2, "solution": "①5×2=10平方厘米，②4×3=12平方厘米，12＞10，②大。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["p34-reviewer", "recheck-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p3_029", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "教室黑板的面积大约是3____。", "answer": "平方米", "kps": ["kp_p3_area"], "difficulty": 0.3, "solution": "黑板长约4米、高约1米，面积用平方米作单位合适。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["p34-reviewer", "recheck-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p3_030", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "正方形花坛边长5米，四周围一圈篱笆。篱笆长多少米？花坛面积多大？（　）", "options": ["A. 篱笆20米，面积25平方米", "B. 篱笆25米，面积20平方米", "C. 篱笆20平方米，面积25米", "D. 篱笆10米，面积10平方米"], "answer": "A", "kps": ["kp_p3_area"], "difficulty": 0.45, "solution": "周长=5×4=20米，面积=5×5=25平方米；B把两个结果调换了，C的单位用反了。", "misconceptions": ["mc_p3_peri_unit"], "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["p34-reviewer", "recheck-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p3_031", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "7月是大月，7月一共有（　）天。", "options": ["A. 30", "B. 28", "C. 31", "D. 29"], "answer": "C", "kps": ["kp_p3_ymd_date"], "difficulty": 0.15, "solution": "一、三、五、七、八、十、腊是大月，每月31天。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["p34-reviewer", "recheck-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p3_032", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "下午3时用24时计时法表示是____时。", "answer": "15", "kps": ["kp_p3_ymd_date"], "difficulty": 0.3, "solution": "下午的时刻加12：3+12=15时。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["p34-reviewer", "recheck-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p3_033", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "运动会开幕式8:30开始，10:15结束，一共进行了（　）分钟。", "options": ["A. 105", "B. 135", "C. 45", "D. 115"], "answer": "A", "kps": ["kp_p3_ymd_date"], "difficulty": 0.45, "solution": "8:30到10:30是2时=120分，往回减15分得105分。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["p34-reviewer", "recheck-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p3_034", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "1元3角用小数表示是____元。", "answer": "1.3", "kps": ["kp_p3_decimal_intro"], "difficulty": 0.15, "solution": "1元是整数部分，3角是0.3元，合起来是1.3元。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["p34-reviewer", "recheck-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p3_035", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "0.8、1.2、0.9、1.1四个数中，最大的是（　）", "options": ["A. 0.8", "B. 1.2", "C. 0.9", "D. 1.1"], "answer": "B", "kps": ["kp_p3_decimal_intro"], "difficulty": 0.3, "solution": "1.2超过1，其余都不到1；1.2与1.1比，十分位2＞1，所以1.2最大。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["p34-reviewer", "recheck-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p3_036", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "买一支钢笔3.5元，付出5元，应找回____元。", "answer": "1.5", "kps": ["kp_p3_decimal_intro"], "difficulty": 0.45, "solution": "5-3.5=1.5元；想3.5+1.5=5。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["p34-reviewer", "recheck-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p3_037", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "复式统计表里记录：三（1）班喜欢跳绳的男生有12人、女生有8人。喜欢跳绳的一共有（　）人。", "options": ["A. 20", "B. 4", "C. 12", "D. 8"], "answer": "A", "kps": ["kp_p3_stats_table"], "difficulty": 0.15, "solution": "复式统计表把男、女生数据合在一张表里，合计12+8=20人。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["p34-reviewer", "recheck-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p3_038", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "喜欢跳绳的男生有10人、女生有14人，男生比女生少____人。", "answer": "4", "kps": ["kp_p3_stats_table"], "difficulty": 0.3, "solution": "14-10=4人。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["p34-reviewer", "recheck-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p3_039", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "喜欢足球的一共有20人，喜欢篮球的一共有16人，喜欢足球的比喜欢篮球的多（　）人。", "options": ["A. 4", "B. 6", "C. 2", "D. 8"], "answer": "A", "kps": ["kp_p3_stats_table"], "difficulty": 0.2, "solution": "20-16=4人。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["p34-reviewer", "recheck-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p3_040", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "2件上衣配3条裤子，一共能搭配出（　）套装。", "options": ["A. 5", "B. 6", "C. 8", "D. 4"], "answer": "B", "kps": ["kp_p3_combination"], "difficulty": 0.15, "solution": "每件上衣配3条裤子，2件就是2×3=6种。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["p34-reviewer", "recheck-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p3_041", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "从学校到公园有2条路，从公园到动物园有3条路，从学校经过公园到动物园有____种走法。", "answer": "6", "kps": ["kp_p3_combination"], "difficulty": 0.3, "solution": "每条去公园的路都接着3条路，2×3=6种。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["p34-reviewer", "recheck-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p3_042", "item_type": "choice", "stem": "用1、2、3三个数字组成没有重复数字的两位数，一共能组成（　）个。", "options": ["A. 3", "B. 6", "C. 9", "D. 12"], "answer": "B", "kps": ["kp_p3_combination"], "difficulty": 0.45, "solution": "有序列举：12、13、21、23、31、32，共3×2=6个。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["p34-reviewer", "recheck-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p3_043", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "计算435-168=____。", "answer": "267", "kps": ["kp_p3_addsub_3digit"], "difficulty": 0.35, "solution": "个位5-8不够减向十位借1，15-8=7；十位借出后剩2，2-6不够再向百位借1，12-6=6；百位4借出1剩3-1=2，得267。写成277的同学是借位后忘了把被借的数减1。", "misconceptions": ["mc_p3_addsub_borrow"], "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["p34-reviewer", "recheck-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
    {"id": "p3_044", "item_type": "fill", "stem": "一块蛋糕平均分成5份，爸爸吃了2份，剩下的部分是这块蛋糕的____。", "answer": "3/5", "kps": ["kp_p3_fraction_intro"], "difficulty": 0.4, "solution": "剩下5-2=3份，就是5份里的3份，即3/5。", "source": "llm_generated", "verification": {"agents": ["p34-reviewer", "recheck-20260930"], "answers_agree": true}},
